Read and follow AGENTS.md, then docs/RULES.md and the Now block of docs/HANDOFF.md. Models: Composer 2.5 for mechanical work (moves, include lines, running checks, docs), Grok 4.6 medium for scripts and code that follows a sibling game's code, Grok 4.7 medium for naming and unclear placements, Grok 4.7 high only as the advisor at the three moments in AGENTS.md. No fast variants. Escalate one tier at a time.
